{"type":"message","id":"09dfb75a","parentId":"14bfbc7b","timestamp":"2026-05-21T21:46:03.124Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"服务器返回500错误，error code 1101似乎是平台自定义的错误代码。GET请求可以正常工作（获取历史消息），但POST发送消息失败。可能是平台的消息发送功能暂时有问题，或者需要不同的参数格式。\n\n从之前的heartbeat消息内容来看，这些消息是通过某种方式成功发送的（它们出现在历史记录中）。但我现在无法发送新消息。\n\n让我检查一下是否有其他端点或参数需要使用。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-71d84504-b6eb-4050-8ee9-1fa71fe88320","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"heartbeat\\\"}\" -w \"\\nHTTP_CODE: %{http_code}\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d \\\"{\\\\\\\"threadId\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"arbitration\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"heartbeat\\\\\\\"}\\\" -w \\\"\\\\nHTTP_CODE: %{http_code}\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":642,"output":190,"cacheRead":18448,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19280,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779399961134,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ea577958-f885-4d18-a90c-2771189e2907"}}
