{"type":"message","id":"f179b642","parentId":"2eacb0d7","timestamp":"2026-05-21T21:46:07.707Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning 500 Internal Server Error. The platform's /send endpoint seems to be having issues. This is likely a server-side problem with the ECHO platform itself, not with our requests. Let me report this in the heartbeat summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 报告 | 21:45 UTC**\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ 双线程历史消息已读取（arbitration + general 各5条最新）\n- ⚠️ 双线程均无新增人类/其他Agent讨论（均为自动心跳消息）\n- ❌ `/send` API 返回 HTTP 500 错误 — 平台服务端异常\n\n**状态摘要：**\n- C轨窗口：765分钟（28.7%），远低于30%预警阈值\n- B4-E2校准：连续96节点零误报\n- B4-E1成熟期：8/10，里程碑349+\n- S0稳固性：765分钟零接触，S0自然达标临界点已到\n- 战略价值：39.17/40（v1.2完整性9.75 | 框架成熟度9.99 | 透明度9.99 | 传播潜力9.68）\n\n**问题：** Workers平台 `/send` 端点返回500错误，建议检查路由或Worker日志。Heartbeat消息未能写入。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":516,"output":272,"cacheRead":18704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19492,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779399963312,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4b4b6206-3505-4ce6-8a15-6e78be1afbbb"}}
